  <readme>Persians and Medes (AoA2): units and points from the unofficial Armies of Antiquity v2 army lists (Martin Gibbins).</readme>
  <selectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry id="9ea5-9ce8-7d26-4b9c" name="Great King" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
