              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Satraps have hand weapon, light armour, thrusting spear and shield. May ride a horse (+8), in which case the shield is discarded. The horse may have half barding (+2). A Satrap may be upgraded to Army General for +50 points.</characteristic>
