              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Standard bearer has hand weapon, light armour and shield. if on foot. May ride a horse (+8), in which case the shield is discarded. The horse may have half barding (+2).</characteristic>
