              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Guards have hand weapon, light armour and javelins and may have composite bow (+4) and half barding (+2), and are Stubborn. Expert horsemen. Both types may have thrusting spear (+3), but in the Cyrus period, only every other unit may do so.</characteristic>
