              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Both types may have thrusting spear (+3), but in the Cyrus period, only every other unit may do so. Light Cavalry have hand weapons and javelins, and may replace javelins with composite bow (+1). Light Cavalry. Expert Horsemen. Feigned Flight. Light Cavalry may be downgraded to Levy status (-5 points, no change in stats).</characteristic>
