            <profile id="c432-293d-299c-67c1" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Both types may have thrusting spear (+3), but in the Cyrus period, only every other unit may do so. Skirmish cavalry have hand weapon and javelins, and may replace javelins with short bow (free). Skirmishers.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
