              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Nobles have hand weapon and javelins. Expert Horsemen. Levy. Shock Cavalry. May have light armour (+2) and short bow (+2) or replace javelins with short bow (free). May have half barding (+2) and thrusting spear (+3) in the Xerxes period only. Heavy Cavalry have hand weapon and javelins. Levy. May have light armour (+2) and short bow (+2) or replace javelins with short bow (free). Skirmishers have hand weapon and javelins. Skirmishers. Levy.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
