              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Immortals are armed with Mixed Weapons and composite bow and may replace bow with Spara (-1). Spara carriers may form the front rank of an otherwise bow-armed unit. Both types may have light armour (+2). Combined Formation.</characteristic>
